 the site and the services we are able to offer. Click on the different category headings to find out more and change our default settings according to your preference. You cannot opt-out of our First Party Strictly Necessary Cookies as they are deployed in order to ensure the proper function of our website (such as prompting the cookie banner and remembering your settings, to log into your account, to redirect you when you log out, etc.). For more information about the First and Third Party Cookies use please follow this link: {privacyLink} {doNotSellLink}",help_center_quick_access_title:"Quick Access",help_center_other_ways_email_us:"Email Us",help_center_contact_login_more_info:"Please {link} to provide us with more information for better service. Or leave your contact information as below",help_center_feedback_note_placeholder:"Please enter a note.",home_highlight_in_stock:"760,000+\nIn Stock",help_center_contact_order_number_placeholder:"Please enter",help_center_feedback_submit:"Submit",home_discount_learn_more:"Learn More >",help_center_quick_link_view_quote_history:"View Quote History",help_agreement_consent_marketing_details:"Marketing Details",help_center_feedback_choose_file:"Choose a file or drag and drop here",home_view_my_coupons:"View my coupons",help_center_nav_help_center:"Help Center",help_cookie_consent_performance_cookie:"Performance Cookies",help_center_quick_link_payment_balance:"Payment & Balance",help_agreement_back:"Back",home_mpn:"MPN",home_brand:"Brand",home_highlight_authorised_brands:"670+ Authorised\nBrands",home_view_exclusive_benefits:"View exclusive benefits >",help_cookie_consent_discription:'LCSC uses cookies and similar technology to improve site performance, enhance security, personal content and ads, and understand how you interact with our services. This information is shared with third-party service providers. Click "Reject-All" to disable all non-essential cookies. By continuing on our site, you agree to our website {terms} a